  "metaTitle": "No-Minimum Custom Dresses | Perfect Imprints",
  "metaDescription": "Order no-minimum custom dresses with low MOQs. Perfect for small teams, events, or samples. Get branded dresses in small quantities at Perfect Imprints.",
  "introHtml": "<p>No-minimum custom dresses let you order exactly what you need, whether it is a single sample, a small team uniform, or a limited run for a special event. Unlike traditional bulk orders, this modifier option removes the pressure of large minimums, making it ideal for small businesses, startups, or one-off occasions. You still get professional quality and branding, but with the flexibility to start small. From bandanas to performance jackets, our inventory supports low-quantity orders without sacrificing customization options.</p>",
